How to read this diff
---------------------
The live-ranker block at the end of the old method is kept verbatim, but it moves
from the end of the method into the middle of it, and a hand-written unified diff
cannot express a move — so it appears in the added hunk above and its old copy is
simply gone. The applied file should contain exactly: the rewritten
`Y042_RetrievalChangeMustPassBothRecallAxes`, the three `Y042*` constants,
`Evidence`, and `AssertMeasuredTheAcceptedCandidate`. Nothing else in
`GetirmeScars.cs` changes.

If the measurement comes back below the gate
--------------------------------------------
The result is kept and the gate stays red. The thresholds are not moved, the gold
set is not edited, and a `run_status` other than `"ok"` is not argued past: under
PROVENANCE.md §3 such a file carries no verdict at all, and this test refuses it
at `Assert.Equal("ok", ...)` before it ever reaches a number.
